  "sn22.5:1.4": "Mendicants are similarly enjoined to develop immersion (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>samādhi</i>) in order to understand the six senses (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn35.99/en/sujato'>SN 35.99</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn35.160/en/sujato'>SN 35.160</a>) and the four noble truths (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn56.1/en/sujato'>SN 56.1</a>). ",
